OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day. Outbreaks of
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain in the morning
OL,7,Fthen dry for a time before further
OL,8,Fshowers develop later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Fresh to strong southerly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA rather cloudy evening with
OL,13,Fsome showers. Then turning drier
OL,14,Fovernight with some clear intervals,
OL,15,Fjust the odd shower in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,18,Fsome sunny intervals. A mainly dry
OL,19,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,20,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,21,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
